From 131427bfd731293771a58426efac2c226cdb137d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jackwubupt-ops <jackwubupt@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:01:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Wire fused INT8 KV reads into the Triton attention
 backend

MHATokenToKVPoolINT8 reads SGLANG_INT8_KV_IMPL once and exposes raw int8
buffers plus scales via get_int8_kv_buffers. With impl=fused the Triton
backend passes them to the extend and decode kernels; plain keeps the
dequantized get_key_buffer path. Fused with deterministic inference raises.
---
 .../srt/layers/attention/triton_backend.py    | 42 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../sglang/srt/layers/quantization/int8_kv.py |  9 ++++
 python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/memory_pool.py    | 16 +++++--
 3 files changed, 60 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/triton_backend.py b/python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/triton_backend.py
